"改期定了：29号周日14:00，河堤东口，原班人马"}]}, "f_0035": {"fact_id": "f_0035", "text": "周六大部队照常骑行", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "骑行安排", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["周六大部队照骑"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21（周六）", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 12:51", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 12:51", "history": []}, "f_0036": {"fact_id": "f_0036", "text": "她年底方案压身，最近骑不动", "subject": "HER", "relation": "状态", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["年底方案压身，我最近骑不动"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 12:51", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 12:51", "history": []}, "f_0037": {"fact_id": "f_0037", "text": "河堤线改期，日期另行通知", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [8, 10], "evidence_quotes": ["问就是改期", "改期定了：29号周日14:00，河堤东口，原班人马"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 12:51", "valid_to": "2026-11-23 20:57", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 12:51", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "河堤线改期，日期另行通知", "valid_to": "2026-11-23 20:57", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "改期定了：29号周日14:00，河堤东口，原班人马"}]}, "f_0038": {"fact_id": "f_0038", "text": "改期定于29号周日14:00，河堤东口集合，原班人马", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "骑行活动约定", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["改期定了：29号周日14:00，河堤东口，原班人马"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-29 14:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:57", "history": []}, "f_0039": {"fact_id": "f_0039", "text": "她的方案已经交了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "工作进度", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["方案交了，人活了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-23", "valid_from": "2026-11-23 20:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:57", "history": []}, "f_0040": {"fact_id": "f_0040", "text": "她说我今天一次链子都没掉，两个长坡也没挂空挡", "subject": "ME", "relation": "骑行表现", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["你今天一次链子都没掉，两个长坡也没挂空挡"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-29", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 17:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 17:37", "history": []}, "f_0041": {"fact_id": "f_0041", "text": "她全程看着并录了视频，说回去发我，文案已想好", "subject": "HER", "relation": "视频", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["视频回去发你，文案我都想好了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-29", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 17:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 17:37", "history": []}, "f_0042": {"fact_id": "f_0042", "text": "老桑问她是不是给我开小灶，她答没有", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "团里玩笑", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["老桑问是不是我给你开小灶了，我说没有"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-29", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 17:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 17:37", "history": []}, "f_0043": {"fact_id": "f_0043", "text": "她把我的掉链子合集和新线首骑剪在一起发了视频，群里叫它励志片", "subject": "HER", "relation": "视频", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["视频发了，你的掉链子合集和新线首骑剪在一起，群里都管它叫励志片"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-29 20:40", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:47", "history": []}, "f_0044": {"fact_id": "f_0044", "text": "老桑按小时租室内骑行台，一小时八块", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "场地租赁", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["入冬转室内骑行台，老桑按小时租，一小时八块"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:47", "history": []}, "f_0045": {"fact_id": "f_0045", "text": "她要凑团办室内骑行台卡，人多能砍到九折，我还没定要不要办", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["你要办卡说一声，我凑个团，能砍到九折"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-29 20:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-29 20:47", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 45, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0020", "action": "complete", "text": "她若没人陪就自己骑共享单车去取车", "old_text": "她若没人陪就自己骑共享单车去取车", "ts": "2026-11-13 19:57", "src_uids": [4], "quote": "车取回来了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0016", "action": "complete", "text": "她想自己先把新河堤线试一遍", "old_text": "她想自己先把新河堤线试一遍", "ts": "2026-11-15 10:37", "src_uids": [5], "quote": "我自己把新河堤线骑完了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0028", "action": "complete", "text": "她想把新河堤线的日子定在下周日", "old_text": "她想把新河堤线的日子定在下周日", "ts": "2026-11-16 21:22", "src_uids": [6], "quote": "通知发了：22号周日14:00，河堤东口集合"}, {"fact_id": "f_0034", "action": "correct", "text": "河堤线改期定于29号周日14:00，河堤东口集合，原班人马", "old_text": "河堤线改期，具体日期未定", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:57", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "改期定了：29号周日14:00，河堤东口，原班人马"}, {"fact_id": "f_0037", "action": "complete", "text": "河堤线改期，日期另行通知", "old_text": "河堤线改期，日期另行通知", "ts": "2026-11-23 20:57", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "改期定了：29号周日14:00，河堤东口，原班人马"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}